  "body": "Farewell school run chaos and hello easy living - with Gulf Harbour Primary just up the road and golf course views right over the fence, this is the kind of location families or retirees fall for fast. Neat and tidy throughout, this single level brick and tile home is move-in ready. Sunny, north-facing and enjoying sea views beyond the manicured fairways, this crowd-pleaser is too good to stay available for long.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Solid single-level brick and tile construction\r\n* North-facing fully fenced backyard backing onto the golf course\r\n* Large sunny deck for entertaining and relaxing\r\n* Light filled conservatory\r\n* Three generous bedrooms\r\n* Master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Sea views out over the golf course\r\n* Double internal access garage\r\n* Beautifully landscaped gardens\r\n\r\nLiving in Gulf Harbour feels like being on holiday all year round. Walk the kids to Gulf Harbour School, tee off next door, head to the marina for brunch, jump on the ferry to the city or spend weekends exploring the selection of beaches and Shakespear Regional Park. It's a location that delivers lifestyle in every direction. Our instructions are crystal clear - this will be sold. If you're after solid, sunny and seriously smart buying, don't wait… slick brick with potential to add value never hangs around for long.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 26th November (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/RR1K\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
